From c57c503eb8c273b6a1f7d4d8126314ba360b49fb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nonu <nonu@a>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 00:50:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Benchmark proxy groups with their own test URL

Groups that set `url` in the config are now benchmarked against it
instead of the global benchmark URL, and their menu items show only the
delays measured against that URL (mihomo keeps them per URL in `extra`).
Groups without their own url keep using the global benchmark URL and
prefer its records. The top-level benchmark also tests select groups
that have their own url.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
